        a: 'Yes. Our Chhani–Ranoli engineering team handles home split/window ACs across Sankarda as well as industrial panel ACs, ductable units, and water chillers in nearby Sankarda–Ranoli industrial plots.',
      },
      {
        q: 'What warranty is included on AC gas charging and PCB repair in Sankarda?',
        a: 'Every refrigerant refill, copper brazing repair, and inverter PCB micro-soldering job in Sankarda carries a written 90-day Atlas Aircon service and parts warranty.',
      },
    ],
  },
  'ac-service-in-samlaya': {
    corridor: 'Savli–Manjusar–Samlaya Industrial & Railway Junction Belt',
    landmarks: 'Samlaya Junction Railway Station, Savli–Jarod State Highway, Manjusar GIDC Extension & Bombardier/Alstom Ancillary Zone',
    sla: '75–95 Minutes via Sama–Savli Express Corridor',
    technicalSummary:
      'Samlaya sits right beyond the Manjusar–Savli GIDC manufacturing hub, hosting railway staff quarters, agro-processing units, engineering workshops, and growing residential societies. Instead of waiting days for city brand centers, Samlaya residents and plant managers get same-day doorstep HVAC diagnostics from our dedicated Sama–Savli corridor mobile van stocked with capacitors, fan motors, copper coils, and sealed R32/R410A cylinders.',
    diagnostics: [
      'Complete split & window AC overhaul with blower wheel extraction and antimicrobial coil wash',
      'Single-phase & three-phase compressor contactor, start/run capacitor, and overload relay replacement',
      'Industrial workshop office ductable AC & water-cooler refrigeration circuit restoration',
      'Precision vacuum evacuation below 500 microns before electronic scale refrigerant charging',
    ],
    faqs: [
      {
        q: 'Are same-day AC repair visits available in Samlaya?',
        a: 'Yes. Our Sama–Savli–Manjusar service vehicle covers Samlaya daily, arriving within 75 to 95 minutes with complete spare parts and gas-charging equipment on board.',
      },
      {
        q: 'Can you repair water coolers and deep freezers in Samlaya workshops?',
        a: 'Yes. Alongside split and window air conditioners, we repair commercial stainless-steel water coolers, cold rooms, and chest freezers across Samlaya and Savli taluka.',
      },
    ],
  },
  'frigidaire-ac-repair-service-center-vadodara': {
    corridor: 'Out-of-Warranty Imported & Legacy Split/Window AC Specialists — Vadodara',
    landmarks: 'Alkapuri, Akota, Race Course, Nizampura, Manjalpur, Gotri & Vasna-Bhayli',
    sla: '60–90 Minutes Across All Vadodara Zones',
    technicalSummary:
      'As an independent out-of-warranty HVAC engineering center, Atlas Aircon specializes in maintaining legacy and imported Frigidaire heavy-duty window, split, and portable air conditioners in Vadodara. Because Frigidaire OEM boards and motors are rarely stocked by general appliance shops, our component-level electronics lab repairs existing control boards, cross-matches exact BTU rotary/reciprocating compressors, and fabricates custom grooved copper coils.',
    diagnostics: [
      'Component-level Frigidaire PCB repair (SMPS power IC, relay drivers, NTC thermistors & display receivers)',
      'Custom 100% grooved copper evaporator & condenser coil fabrication where imported spares are discontinued',
      'Safe R22-to-R407C / R32/R410A drop-in compatibility assessment and POE/mineral oil flushing',
