      },
      {
        q: 'Can you fix old Frigidaire units when spare boards are discontinued?',
        a: 'Yes. Our electronics bench repairs the original Frigidaire PCB at component level or installs a calibrated universal inverter/non-inverter control kit with full thermostat and louver functionality.',
      },
    ],
  },
  'voltas-ac-service-center-vadodara': {
    corridor: 'Independent Out-of-Warranty Voltas Split, Adjustable Inverter, Window & Cassette AC Specialists',
    landmarks: 'Sayajiganj HQ, Alkapuri, Karelibaug, Manjalpur, Waghodia Road, Gotri, Bhayli & Makarpura GIDC',
    sla: '60 Minutes Across Vadodara Urban Wards',
    technicalSummary:
      'Voltas All-Weather and Adjustable Inverter air conditioners are among the most widely installed cooling units across Vadodara homes, banks, and retail showrooms. Atlas Aircon provides rapid independent out-of-warranty Voltas AC servicing—resolving E1/E6 communication faults, F1/F2/F3 sensor codes, EL-01 indoor-outdoor mismatch trips, and micro-channel condenser leaks without multi-day queue delays.',
    diagnostics: [
      'Voltas inverter error code troubleshooting (E1, E6, EL 01, F1/F2/F3, H6 BLDC motor & P4 IPM faults)',
      'Permanent conversion of leaking aluminum micro-channel outdoor condensers to heavy-gauge 100% copper coils',
