      {
        q: 'How do you fix frequent gas leaks in Voltas outdoor condensers?',
        a: 'Many older condensers suffer galvanic pinhole corrosion near open drains. We either silver-braze copper U-bends tested to 350 PSI dry nitrogen or upgrade micro-channel condensers to 100% pure copper coils with anti-corrosive coating.',
      },
    ],
